     "value": "Except for radiopharmaceuticals and homeopathic products, the Nordic number is required on the label of all medicines, written 'Vnr XX XX XX'; a barcode or 2D code is optional under Nordic rules, while 2D codes are required for most human medicines under the Falsified Medicines Directive."
